<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers AG said it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in four equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.	 PAYDATE	28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, STUTT, DUSS    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  32 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE  EXERCISE PERIOD	    STRIKE	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A   29.NOV.96-26.JUN.97	32 DEM	  2.28 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B   29.NOV.96-19.SEP.97	34 DEM	  1.80 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C   29.NOV.96-12.DEC.97	36 DEM	  1.60 DEM</p>
<p> CALL D   29.NOV.96-19.MAR.98	38 DEM	  1.47 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
